abstract: "A dependency-free site where you type what you want to do in plain language and get the exact Git commands, a danger level for each, and its undo. Covers first setup through history surgery, and every major host: GitHub, GitLab, Bitbucket, Azure DevOps, and AWS CodeCommit."
